developers, GPL-3.0-or-later, taken under GPL-3.0. Figure F7 is computed on orix-data's Ti_orientations.ctf (CC BY 4.0,
Krakow et al. 2017), fetched by tools/parity/sem/fetch-data.sh, not committed.

The .ang writer in Sources/TEMCore/SEM/Export/ANGWriter.swift is a port of orix 0.15.0's orix.io.plugins.ang file_writer,
