The texture functions in Sources/TEMCore/SEM/Texture/ (EqualAreaGrid, PoleDensityFunction, PoleFigures) port orix 0.15.0's
orix.measure.pole_density_function, orix.sampling.S2_sampling's equal-area coordinates and the pole symmetrisation of
orix.vector.miller, Copyright (C) 2018-2026 the orix developers, GPL-3.0-or-later, taken under GPL-3.0; the smoothing is
scipy.ndimage.gaussian_filter's kernel and boundary modes (SciPy, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2001-2002 Enthought, Inc.
