kikuchipy (the SEM readers are ported from it; its test data are fixtures)
================================================================================

The NORDIF readers (Sources/TEMCore/SEM/NORDIF) are ported from kikuchipy 0.13.1
(https://github.com/pyxem/kikuchipy, `kikuchipy/io/plugins/nordif` and `nordif_calibration_patterns`), Copyright
2019-2026 the kikuchipy developers, GPL-3.0-or-later, rewritten in Swift with the same conventions; each file names its
source in its first lines. macTEMTests/Fixtures/sem/nordif holds kikuchipy's `data/nordif` test files unchanged
(GPL-3.0-or-later; the patterns are from the recrystallised nickel dataset of Ånes et al. 2020, CC BY 4.0,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7497682).

The master pattern reader and the projection onto a detector (Sources/TEMCore/SEM/MasterPattern) are ported from kikuchipy
0.13.1 (`kikuchipy/io/plugins/_emsoft_master_pattern.py` and the EBSD, TKD and ECP master pattern plugins,
`kikuchipy/signals/ebsd_master_pattern.py::get_patterns`, `kikuchipy/signals/util/_master_pattern.py`,
`kikuchipy/detectors/_ebsd_detector.py`), Copyright 2019-2026 the kikuchipy developers, GPL-3.0-or-later. The direction
cosines and the interpolation in the square Lambert projection are kikuchipy's adaptation of EMsoft, whose notice it
